# Real-timer waits still allowed in tests (bin/lib/test_waits.rb). One line per file and rule:
#   PATH  RULE  COUNT  REASON
# COUNT is exact (a ratchet). "kept:" a wait that is the behaviour under test or teardown only;
# "pending:" not migrated yet (delivery-evidence/await-helper/report.md). Add none without a reason.

